          "heading": "Fiji target maiden tournament win following previous 34-21 defeat against France",
          "body": "Fiji sit bottom of the Nations Championship log with three losses from three matches played this season. Their Round 3 result was a 17-33 defeat against Scotland. The Flying Fijians now face France, who won the last meeting between the sides 34-21 during an away test in November 2025. With a point differential of -96, the team must improve defensively to secure their first victory of the campaign."
