      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "COACHING CONSULTANT",
          "heading": "England Women appoint Shaun Edwards as consultant after talks over men's role",
          "body": "Shaun Edwards has joined the Red Roses as a consultant coach during the WXV Global Series, following his revelation that he has previously spoken to England regarding the men’s senior job. The former Wales and France defence coach, who aims to win the Six Nations with a third team, confirmed he would not badger for a position. Edwards, supporting head coach John Mitchell’s side, described the opportunity to wear the rose as a significant milestone after previous chances to join the men's setup passed him by."
