          "kicker": "Media standoff",
          "heading": "Saracens face league fines as Brendan Venter continues media duty boycott",
          "body": "Saracens face potential fines and a formal disciplinary process after Brendan Venter continued his boycott of mandatory media duties. The club recently rebranded Venter’s role to \"head of rugby culture and wine consultant\", a move seen as an attempt to exploit loopholes in league regulations. However, officials are investigating the persistent no-shows as a breach of participation agreements. While the club attempts to navigate these requirements, the league remains firm on enforcing access for broadcasters and the written press."
        },
