          "kicker": "Team selection",
          "heading": "Ireland Women name Jane Clohessy and Niamh Gallagher for maiden Test starts",
          "body": "Head coach Scott Bemand has handed first international starts to Munster second row Jane Clohessy and full-back Niamh Gallagher for Saturday’s second Test against Japan. The meeting at Virgin Media Park sees captain Erin King lead a side featuring three potential debutants on the bench: Sophie Barrett, Kate Jordan and Alana McInerney. Back-row star Aoife Wafer is omitted as a precaution following a minor training injury, while Anna McGann shifts to centre to partner Aoife Dalton in a refreshed midfield."
        },
