          "kicker": "FORM GUIDE",
          "heading": "Italy search for first victory after recording four consecutive international defeats",
          "body": "Italy have lost four consecutive matches. Their most recent result was a 10-57 defeat against Australia away in July during the Nations Championship group stage. In their last five games, the side has recorded one win and four losses. The Azzurri are currently 11th in the standings following a demanding summer schedule in the Southern Hemisphere. Gonzalo Quesada’s side will look to end this winless run when the international window resumes in November."
        },
