          "heading": "Cameron Redpath earns first Bath start alongside Finn Russell against Exeter Chiefs",
          "body": "Cameron Redpath will make his first start of the season for Bath in tonight’s Premiership clash with Exeter Chiefs. The centre joins fellow Scotland international Finn Russell in the starting XV, with the fly-half retaining his No. 10 jersey following the club’s opening-round victory. Redpath slots in at inside centre alongside Ollie Lawrence, displacing England international Max Ojomoh to the bench. The selection provides a timely boost for Gregor Townsend as he monitors midfield options ahead of Scotland’s upcoming test against New Zealand."
