          "heading": "Steve Tandy defines 12-match countdown to 2027 Rugby World Cup",
          "body": "With exactly one year until Wales begin their campaign in Australia, the national side has outlined its path to an opening Pool F fixture against Zimbabwe. Head coach Steve Tandy has identified a 12-match schedule to whittle his current alignment squad of over 50 players down to the final 33. The build-up includes upcoming Nations Championship tests and a full Six Nations campaign before summer fitness camps. Wales must also navigate pool matches against Tonga and England as they seek to improve their current world ranking of 11th."
