          "body": "Argentina have demonstrated a prolific but leaky attacking profile throughout their recent international programme. In their last 11 fixtures, Los Pumas have scored 321 points, while conceding 346 points. These figures represent an average of 29.2 points scored and 31.5 points conceded per match. Their most notable attacking performance in this window remains the 52-28 victory secured against Wales in November 2025."
