          "kicker": "Disciplinary blow",
          "heading": "Hunter Paisami misses Bledisloe Cup tests following four-week suspension",
          "body": "Wallabies centre Hunter Paisami has been ruled out of the upcoming Bledisloe Cup series after failing to overturn a suspension for a dangerous tackle. Paisami received the ban for a contrary tackle on South Africa’s Sacha Feinberg-Mngomezulu during the recent victory in Perth. Although the initial six-week sanction was reduced by two weeks due to mitigating factors, head coach Les Kiss admitted frustration with the verdict, stating, “I thought it could have been a little bit less than that, for sure.”"
